00:04:30.672 --> 00:04:35.752
That extra-emission plateau showed up in helium and did not show up in argon or neon.

00:04:36.452 --> 00:04:41.312
Nature photonics published the results, which rest on laser methods built at TU Ween

00:04:41.312 --> 00:04:46.152
